{"id":"500509","name":"猴头菇乌鸡山药汤","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"","cover":"images/500509/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"乌鸡","amount":"半只"},{"name":"泡发猴头菇","amount":"50克"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"山药","amount":"半根"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"4片"},{"name":"葱段","amount":"4段"},{"name":"红枸杞","amount":"1把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：乌鸡，胡萝卜，山药。","img":"images/500509/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"干猴头菇泡发。","img":"images/500509/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"乌鸡斩块清洗干净。","img":"images/500509/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"乌鸡在开水锅中焯烫3分钟。","img":"images/500509/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜切滚刀块。","img":"images/500509/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"山药去皮切片泡于清水中，以免氧化变黑。","img":"images/500509/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"焯烫的乌鸡肉清洗干净，放入砂锅内。","img":"images/500509/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"铺上胡萝卜快。","img":"images/500509/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"在铺上猴头菇。","img":"images/500509/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入姜片、葱段和红枸杞，加入食盐和开水。","img":"images/500509/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"砂锅放电灶上，中火煮沸之后转小火炖煮40分钟。","img":"images/500509/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到了之后，放入山药片在煮15分钟。","img":"images/500509/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/500509/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}